{
  "name": "dsh-deepseek-keypool",
  "version": "3.0.0",
  "description": "DSH Provider 分档故障转移 —— 模型请求以额度/凭据/过载/限流等可切换失败结束时，按配置表档位顺序切换 harness 路由（provider）；凭据类失败先在条目内轮换 key（改写该路由的 apiKeyEnv 引用名，路由与模型不变，模型列表不会多出条目），并按每日重置时刻恢复默认 key。Host 半负责转移与设置命名空间，客户端半只提供「设置 → 故障转移」小节；不持有也不读写任何凭据值。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.2"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "plugin",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "provider-failover",
    "failover"
  ],
  "license": "MIT"
}
